<p class="ingredients-card-title-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">Hyaluronic Acid</p>
<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG"><p>A powerful humectant that attracts and retains moisture, plumping the skin and reducing the appearance of fine lines.</p></div>
<p class="ingredients-modal-slide-title-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">BENEFITS</p>
<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-sub-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">
<p>By binding water within the skin, hyaluronic acid significantly boosts hydration levels. This results in a smoother, more supple appearance and can diminish the visibility of wrinkles and dehydration lines, providing a youthful bounce.</p>
</div>
<a class="ingredients-modal-button-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG" href="/pages/404-2">
