<p class="ingredients-card-title-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">Avocado</p>
<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG"><p>The creamy flesh of the avocado fruit, rich in vitamins, minerals, and healthy fats that deeply moisturize and replenish the skin.</p></div>
<p class="ingredients-modal-slide-title-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">BENEFITS</p>
<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-sub-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">
<p>Avocado is packed with essential fatty acids and vitamins A, D, and E, which help to hydrate, soothe, and improve skin elasticity. It can leave the skin feeling soft, supple, and deeply nourished.</p>
