<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG"><p>A gentle and effective clay that helps to absorb excess oil and impurities, leaving the skin feeling balanced and clean.</p></div>
<p class="ingredients-modal-slide-title-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">BENEFITS</p>
<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-sub-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">
