<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG"><p>Finely ground powder of specially grown and processed green tea leaves, known for its potent antioxidant properties.</p></div>
<p class="ingredients-modal-slide-title-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">BENEFITS</p>
<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-sub-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG">
