<div class="ingredients-modal-slide-text-template--23624315830601__ss_product_ingredients_6_UkybkG"><p>A mineral-rich clay formed from volcanic ash, known for its powerful ability to draw out impurities, toxins, and excess oil from the skin.</p></div>
